    {
        "content": "<p>As someone who has no idea what MeromorphicAt means, here's my attempt:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>put <code>set_option trace.Meta.Tactic.fun_prop true</code> before the statement</li>\n<li>read trace saying </li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">applying</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`MeromorphicAt</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">theorems</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`Complex.cosh</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">               </span><span class=\"n\">trying</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">again</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decomposing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cosh</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∘</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">missing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">composition</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prove</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`MeromorphicAt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cosh</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>look for <code>MeromorphicAt</code> + <code>comp</code>with search tools (I just went to docs)</li>\n<li>final proof:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℂ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeromorphicAt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cosh</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">change</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeromorphicAt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cosh</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∘</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeromorphicAt</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">comp_analyticAt</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">fun_prop</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>My guess is you can probably tag <code>MeromorphicAt.comp_analyticAt</code> with fun_prop, but I don't know enough about it to be sure.</p>",
        "id": 582280079,
        "sender_full_name": "ZhiKai Pong",
        "timestamp": 1774657006
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"890057\">ZhiKai Pong</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Diagnose.20failing.20.60fun_prop.60/near/582280079\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>My guess is you can probably tag <code>MeromorphicAt.comp_analyticAt</code> with fun_prop, but I don't know enough about it to be sure.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>As the author of that lemma, I agree this is exactly the right solution. This is confirmed by the fact that the following code <em>does</em> work:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">fun_prop</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeromorphicAt</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">comp_analyticAt</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℂ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MeromorphicAt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Complex</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cosh</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fun_prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- works</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I encourage you to make a mathlib PR adding the fun_prop tag, and message me for a review.</p>",
